# 6. ACCOUNT-SERVICE — PATCH /accounts/{id}/limits  (solo ADMIN)
###############################################################################

### 6.1 [POSITIVO] Admin ajusta minBalance de una cuenta normal (pocket / reserva protegida) -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{createSecondAccount.response.body.$.id}}/limits
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minBalance": 0
}

