PATCH {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc-treasury/limits
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minBalance": -1000000
}

### 6.3 [NEGATIVO] Como USER (no admin) -> 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}/limits
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minBalance": 0
}

### 6.4 [NEGATIVO] minBalance ausente -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR (minBalance: must not be null)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}/limits
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6.5 [NEGATIVO] Cuenta inexistente -> 404 ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc-no-existe-12345/limits
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minBalance": 0
}


###############################################################################
# 7. TRANSFER-SERVICE (via gateway) — POST /api/v1/points/transfer
###############################################################################

### 7.1 [POSITIVO] Admin fondea la cuenta del usuario desde acc-treasury -> 202 PENDING
# Requiere haber corrido 6.2 primero (minBalance de acc-treasury sin piso real)
# @name fundAccount
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/points/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "acc-treasury",
  "targetAccountId": "{{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "amount": 100
}

### 7.2 [POSITIVO] Transferencia normal entre 2 cuentas del mismo usuario -> 202 PENDING
# Correr 7.1 primero y esperar unos segundos a que la saga complete el fondeo
# @name transferBetweenAccounts
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/points/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "targetAccountId": "{{createSecondAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "amount": 40
}

### 7.3 [NEGATIVO] Cuenta origen y destino iguales -> 400 SAME_ACCOUNT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/points/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "targetAccountId": "{{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "amount": 10
}

### 7.4 [NEGATIVO] Saldo insuficiente (monto mayor al balance real) -> 422 INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/points/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "targetAccountId": "{{createSecondAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "amount": 999999999
}

### 7.5 [NEGATIVO] Cuenta origen inactiva -> 422 SOURCE_INACTIVE
# Antes de correr esto: desactivar createOtherAccount con un PATCH .../status {"status":"INACTIVE"} (ver 5.1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/points/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOtherUser.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{createOtherAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "targetAccountId": "{{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "amount": 10
}

### 7.6 [NEGATIVO] Cuenta destino inactiva -> 422 TARGET_INACTIVE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/points/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "targetAccountId": "{{createOtherAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "amount": 10
}

### 7.7 [NEGATIVO] Cuenta origen inexistente -> 404 ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/points/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "acc-no-existe-12345",
  "targetAccountId": "{{createSecondAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "amount": 10
}

### 7.8 [NEGATIVO] Monto negativo -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR (amount: must be positive)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/points/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "targetAccountId": "{{createSecondAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "amount": -10
}

### 7.9 [NEGATIVO] Monto cero -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR (amount: must be positive)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/points/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "targetAccountId": "{{createSecondAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "amount": 0
}

### 7.10 [NEGATIVO] sourceAccountId en blanco -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR (sourceAccountId: must not be blank)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/points/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "",
  "targetAccountId": "{{createSecondAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "amount": 10
}

### 7.11 [NEGATIVO] Body vacio -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR (falla en el primer campo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/points/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 7.12 [NEGATIVO] Sin token -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/points/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{createAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "targetAccountId": "{{createSecondAccount.response.body.$.id}}",
  "amount": 10
}

### 7.13 [NOTA] No existe chequeo de ownership del lado de transfer-service para sourceAccountId:
# cualquier usuario autenticado con rol USER/ADMIN puede pedir transferir DESDE una cuenta que
# no es suya (la saga la ejecuta igual si el saldo/estado lo permiten). Este es un hallazgo
# documentado en la auditoria 2026-09-15 pendiente de backlog, no un bug de este archivo.


